  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### 🐛 Fixed\n* Version.GracefulParse now stops parsing at the end of the version: prerelease tags, release groups and architecture tags (e.g. 10.0.100-preview.1, 5.2.15(1)-release, 3.10.11 (x64)) are ignored instead of having their digits appended to version components\n* Version.GracefulParse no longer falls back to the UTF-16 code point of the first character, so inputs like -5 parse as 5.0 instead of 53.0.0.0\n* Version.GracefulParse now skips non-version prefixes such as x64 before the first version component",
